<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 0.4 percent in Nov.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 0.4 percent in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 0.4 percent in November, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   NOV 96     YR TO DATE</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +0.4	 +0.3</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +3.2	 +1.8</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     -2.4	 -1.5</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
